# Lesson 4: Data Visualization with Matplotlib

I explored basic plots using Matplotlib.

```python
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

# Sample data
categories = ["Apples", "Bananas", "Cherries"]
values = [10, 15, 7]

# Bar plot
plt.bar(categories, values)
plt.title("Fruit Sales")
plt.xlabel("Fruits")
plt.ylabel("Sales")
plt.show()
```